MODULE: PublishedMigrationMatchesTargetWrongCopy
TARGET: PublishedMigrationMatchesTarget
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a late migration writes its diff onto a new alias target rather than refusing it
PERTURBS: MigrationPublish

--- FIND
    /\ operation \notin {"resize", "undo"} /\ alias = migrationCopy
    /\ maps' = [maps EXCEPT ![migrationCopy] = target]
--- REPLACE
    /\ operation \notin {"resize", "undo"}
    /\ maps' = [maps EXCEPT ![alias] = target]
--- END
